  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Teacher Training in Uzbekistan: Joint IsDB-GPE Smart ED</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project proposes a transformative approach to in-service teacher professional development by aligning the current system with Continuous Professional Learning (CPL), developing a school-based mentorship model, and piloting blended CPL programs for various education professionals. These initiatives aim to enhance professional standards, improve access and inclusivity, and support system-wide scalability, enabling continuous, school-based learning for educators across Uzbekistan.</narrative>
  </description>
